  "name": "Review decision",
  "definition": "One reviewer's append-only decision on one review slide: approved, changes requested, or none to withdraw. It records the review head and slide digest; only the latest event for that reviewer seat is presented, with currency recomputed when the slide or its referenced code changes. It is not an app-wide verdict and does not apply to documentation slides. A bodiless repeat at the same state, head and slide digest records nothing, as does withdrawing when the seat holds no decision.",
